OL,3,GNEWSAMinister apologises over minimum
OL,4,Awage comments
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief Minister Senator Lyndon Farnham
OL,7,Fsaid: "Ministers are entitled to hold
OL,8,Fdifferent views, but significant policy
OL,9,Fmatters must be properly considered
OL,10,Fthrough the appropriate ministerial
OL,11,Fprocesses."
